from sys-sphere-growth.replay
# sys-underground-treasure (mining.c, menus.c): a second board, after the first, with rocks:
# a Heart Scale and two Spheres, struck with the pickaxe; the Heart Scale goes from TREASURES into the bag (PUT IN BAG).
# Setup: 48 minutes on (the visit's mining generator takes the arrival's clock: this board), down at a bulging wall
# south-west of the vendors' corridor.
time 12:48
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_UNDERGROUND 181 167 left
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
until app mining
+1 tap yes
# The fade, the ping and "Something pinged in the wall!" (no tutorial on a second board).
+110 tap hit:200,88
+3 tap hit:200,104
+3 tap hit:72,56
+3 tap hit:120,56
+3 tap hit:88,72
+3 tap hit:136,72
+3 tap hit:184,88
+3 tap hit:200,104
until app none 3000
+0 assert state underground.treasures [35]
+0 assert state underground.records.otherDug 1
+0 press x
+1 release x
until app ug-menu
+1 tap entry:3
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap menu:0
+1 assert state underground.treasures []
+0 assert state bag.items [{"item":"platinum:ITEM_HEART_SCALE","count":1}]
+1 tap next
+1 tap back
+1 tap back
until app none
until idle
